{
  "id": "m36l2",
  "title": {
    "es": "sorted con key",
    "en": "sorted with a key"
  },
  "theory": {
    "es": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Ordenar por un criterio"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "`sorted(iterable, key=funcion)` ordena usando el resultado de `funcion` para cada elemento. Así ordenas por longitud, por valor absoluto, por un campo…"
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "palabras = ['casa', 'sol', 'arbol']",
          "print(sorted(palabras, key=len))",
          "print(sorted([-5, 2, -1], key=abs))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "['sol', 'casa', 'arbol']",
          "[-1, 2, -5]"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Añade `reverse=True` para orden descendente. El orden es **estable**: empates conservan su orden original."
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "`key` recibe una función que se aplica a cada elemento; suele ser una lambda o `len`, `abs`, `str.lower`…"
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "value": "Sorting by a criterion"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "`sorted(iterable, key=func)` sorts using the result of `func` for each element. That's how you sort by length, absolute value, a field…"
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "value": [
          "palabras = ['casa', 'sol', 'arbol']",
          "print(sorted(palabras, key=len))",
          "print(sorted([-5, 2, -1], key=abs))"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "output",
        "value": [
          "['sol', 'casa', 'arbol']",
          "[-1, 2, -5]"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Add `reverse=True` for descending order. Sorting is **stable**: ties keep their original order."
      },
      {
        "type": "note",
        "value": "`key` takes a function applied to each element; often a lambda or `len`, `abs`, `str.lower`…"
      }
    ]
  },
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "m36l2e1",
      "prompt": {
        "es": "Define `por_longitud(palabras)` que devuelva las palabras ordenadas de más corta a más larga.",
        "en": "Define `por_longitud(palabras)` returning the words sorted from shortest to longest."
      },
      "starter_code": [
        "def por_longitud(palabras):",
        "    pass"
      ],
      "solution": [
        "def por_longitud(palabras):",
        "    return sorted(palabras, key=len)"
      ],
      "hints": {
        "es": [
          "sorted(palabras, key=len)."
        ],
        "en": [
          "sorted(palabras, key=len)."
        ]
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "type": "function",
          "function": "por_longitud",
          "cases": [
            {
              "args": [
                [
                  "casa",
                  "sol",
                  "arbol"
                ]
              ],
              "expected": [
                "sol",
                "casa",
                "arbol"
              ]
            },
            {
              "args": [
                [
                  "bb",
                  "a"
                ]
              ],
              "expected": [
                "a",
                "bb"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
